{
  "_comment": [
    "Asset model for the CRPMS demonstrator.",
    "KPCL -> Station -> Unit -> System -> Equipment -> Parameter (\u00a7392).",
    "Adding a unit is an entry in 'elements' below -- one object, no code.",
    "Tag patterns resolve against an element's context, so the same template",
    "produces U1_MS_TEMP for one unit and U2_MS_TEMP for the next.",
    "Naming follows ISA-95/ISA-88; the convention is in engine/README.md (\u00a7385)."
  ],
